  tenant="Water Filter Pitchers" products=1       t0_rss_kb=2244     with_tenant_rss_kb=2400     steady_state_rss_kb=2724     growth_kb=324      total_queries_served=197938764  samples: t5s=2592KB t10s=2596KB t15s=2596KB t20s=2596KB

H7 comparison: idle-resident growth=350.7 KB (16.2% of t0), max active-resident tenant growth=324 KB
  H7 verdict: CONFIRMED -- steady-state RSS after sustained residency is materially higher than H6's immediate snapshot; a genuinely long-running service costs more than the short-lived-process floor

